# Env & secrets — keep keys out of build context.
# Encrypted production config stays in Git for dotenvx-managed storage.
# Coolify injects decrypted runtime values; neither ciphertext nor private
# keys belong in image layers, build caches, or the Next build environment.
.env
.env.*
.env.keys
!.env.example

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
.git
**/*.pem
**/*.key
